Description: VeltOS Calendar, in the layout of Windows 11's Calendar app
 Day, work week, week, month and year views with "Today" and the previous
 and next arrows, a small month and "New event" on the left, Windows'
 quick card for a new event (name, date and time, all day, place,
 reminder) and the full editor (repeat, reminder, description), in
 English and Turkish.
 .
 Events are kept in an iCalendar file (~/.local/share/veltos-calendar/
 calendar.ics) that other calendar programs can import. VeltOS Clock's
 background agent (veltos-clock) shows the reminders while Calendar is
 closed.
